# Copy to .dev.vars for local development. Never commit real values.

# The origin `vite dev` serves on. Without this the Worker uses the deployed
# `APP_ORIGIN` from `wrangler.jsonc`, which no local page matches: every write
# fails `ORIGIN_FORBIDDEN`, and opening a local management link sends the browser
# to the production recovery page instead of exchanging the credential.
APP_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
TOKEN_HMAC_KEY=replace-with-a-32-byte-or-longer-random-secret
SESSION_HMAC_KEY=replace-with-a-different-32-byte-or-longer-random-secret
GUEST_TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY=replace-with-32-random-bytes-encoded-as-base64url
LOGIN_HMAC_KEY=replace-with-another-32-byte-or-longer-random-secret

# Persisted-data keys, not session rotation controls. ENTRY_* protect the
# credential printed on invitations, RSVP_LOOKUP_HMAC_KEY keys stored name
# digests, and GUEST_MESSAGE_HMAC_KEY keys durable Guestbook replay receipts
# plus bounded rate-window digests. Rotating any of them without a coordinated
# re-encryption, re-HMAC, or invalidation migration breaks persisted behavior.
# Ordinary guest-grant and session rotation leaves all four alone.
ENTRY_HMAC_KEY=replace-with-a-different-32-byte-or-longer-random-secret
ENTRY_ENCRYPTION_KEY=replace-with-32-random-bytes-encoded-as-base64url
RSVP_LOOKUP_HMAC_KEY=replace-with-another-32-byte-or-longer-random-secret
GUEST_MESSAGE_HMAC_KEY=replace-with-an-independent-32-byte-or-longer-random-secret
